          "worked": "HCF $=9$. Divide each term by $9$:\n$$\\begin{align*}9x+18&=9\\left(\\frac{9x}{9}+\\frac{18}{9}\\right)\\\\9x+18&=9(x+2)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
